<title>HUNGARY: Hungary 1-mo BUBOR rate 21.51 pct, 3-mo 21.28 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary 1-mo BUBOR rate 21.51 pct, 3-mo 21.28 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rates (BUBOR) dipped for the one-month maturity to 21.51 percent, down 0.01 and remained unchanged at 21.28 percent for the three-month maturity, the National Bank of Hungary (NBH) said.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 40 0</p>
